This package references static Pyraminx, Skewb, and Megaminx sticker geometry
and move permutation data from cubing.js PuzzleGeometry without bundling
cubing.js as a runtime dependency:

    Name:       cubing
    Source:     https://github.com/cubing/cubing.js
    License:    MPL-2.0 OR GPL-3.0-or-later
    Use:        Static non-cube sticker coordinates and player move mappings

